Package: mintmotion
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: cinnamon (>= 6.0) | xfdesktop4, mpv, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-xlib, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, ffmpeg
Recommends: mesa-va-drivers, pkexec, xfwm4 | cinnamon
Conflicts: fondo-video
Replaces: fondo-video
Maintainer: José Antonio Ramos Miralles (Sombra) <hola@joseantonioramos.es>
Homepage: https://github.com/MintMotion/mintmotion
Description: MintMotion - video wallpaper for the Cinnamon and Xfce desktops
 Plays a video as the desktop background in Linux Mint and LMDE (Cinnamon
 or Xfce, X11 session), below the desktop icons and all windows, with
 hardware decoding. It pauses by itself when the desktop is fully covered
 and keeps playing while any part of it is visible; if it stays covered
 for two minutes, the player is closed and all its memory is freed.
 .
 Includes the "MintMotion" application to choose the video and the options.
 Available in English, Spanish, French and Simplified Chinese.
